// Title: SKILL.md says `&selstyle` for a list's `#highlight_style: &[Style, null]`
// needs `val selstyle: [Style, null]`; `&T` is covariant, so `val selstyle: Style` is accepted.
// Command: graphix --check main.gx
// Expected (per SKILL.md): refused. Observed: accepted (exit 0).
mod a;
use tui::list::list;
list(#highlight_style: &a::selstyle, &[])
